{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ", "target_text": "Hello", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಶುಭೋದಯ", "target_text": "Good morning", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಧನ್ಯವಾದಗಳು", "target_text": "Thank you", "category": "courtesy"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಪುಸ್ತಕವನ್ನು ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ.", "target_text": "Open your book.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಎದ್ದು ನಿಲ್ಲಿ.", "target_text": "Stand up.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಕುಳಿತುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.", "target_text": "Sit down.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಐದು ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಯನ್ನು ಬರೆಯಿರಿ.", "target_text": "Write number five.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ಎಣಿಸಿ.", "target_text": "Count the objects.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಚಿತ್ರವನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ.", "target_text": "Look at the picture.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಈ ಪದವನ್ನು ಓದಿ.", "target_text": "Read this word.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ನನ್ನ ನಂತರ ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿಸಿ.", "target_text": "Repeat after me.", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "en", "source_text": "ಯಾರು ಉತ್ತರಿಸಬಹುದು?", "target_text": "Who can answer?", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
